{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11208090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11208090","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1120809001:1":{"text":"You! What are you doing here?!","source_cn":"你！你怎么会在这里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34C5D8F49912F741","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120809002:1":{"text":"Are you up to no good again?","source_cn":"你又在盘算什么坏主意呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x043D62B9002AB27A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120809003:1":{"text":"Come on... Let's let bygones be bygones, my beautiful furballs! My blowgun barely grazed you that time. You woke up quick, didn't you?","source_cn":"哎呀……忘了之前的不愉快吧，仓鼠老弟。我那麻痹毒液的吹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CA2F7D53E947D15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120809004:1":{"text":"And that fox girl got her necklace back, right?","source_cn":"狐狸妹子也拿回了项链，而且完好无损，对不？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EAD8CCD40DC33C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120809005:1":{"text":"Look, I just happened to find that pretty little thing on the ground, and thanks to you kind-hearted folks, it found its way back to its rightful owner. No harm done.","source_cn":"我只是路上偶然捡到那么漂亮的东西，拿来欣赏欣赏，没别的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BA2ADC591CAB3A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1120809005":{"text":"Look, I just happened to find that pretty little thing on the ground, and thanks to you kind-hearted folks, it found its way back to its rightful owner. No harm done.","source_cn":"我只是路上偶然捡到那么漂亮的东西，拿来欣赏欣赏，没别的意思——还都要多亏正义的老爷小姐们，才能准确找到失主啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BA2ADC591CAB3A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120809006:1":{"text":"What? No, I'm speaking from the heart here! It's true!","source_cn":"不不，我说的每句话都发自肺腑、真心诚意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE231C044B398727E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120809008:1":{"text":"Look, this news about Lord Pike is sweeping across the desert like a sandstorm. It's all over town. I just came to see what's going on!","source_cn":"瞧，这荒矛老爷的消息稀奇得和沙漠里的暴雨似的，在镇上传...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6BE2D6D21004CF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120809009:1":{"text":"The bounty reward sounds nice, but I'm not sure if it's for real...","source_cn":"悬赏给的东西听起来可真不错，就是不知道是真是假……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA51E613F2AEAEFCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1120809009":{"text":"The bounty reward sounds nice, but I'm not sure if it's for real...","source_cn":"悬赏给的东西听起来可真不错，就是不知道是真是假……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA51E613F2AEAEFCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120809010:1":{"text":"I'm still asking around too. If you're interested, why don't we have a chat with his butler? I mean it couldn't hurt, right?","source_cn":"这不，还在打听呢。你们要是也有兴趣，咱一起找老爷的执事...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x789D30B637C8FB02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"What's the reward?","source_cn":"悬赏是什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x551D700C4C46F7A8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What's the reward?","female":"What's the reward?","variant_male_record_index":"63832","variant_female_record_index":"63833","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:1:2":{"text":"Do you know who Lord Pike is?","source_cn":"你知道荒矛老爷是谁吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4FE492FF37A799E1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Do you know who Lord Pike is?","female":"Do you know who Lord Pike is?","variant_male_record_index":"63834","variant_female_record_index":"63835","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"What a load of crap...","source_cn":"真是油嘴滑舌……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x14B7B0137AF63A1E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What a load of crap...","female":"What a load of crap...","variant_male_record_index":"63826","variant_female_record_index":"63827","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120809007:1":{"text":"What? No, I'm speaking from the heart here! It's true!","source_cn":"不不，我说的每句话都发自肺腑、真心诚意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89E95775A3481913","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"You're not here by accident.","source_cn":"你不是偶然出现在这里","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0C3E899BA1C0DE3A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You're not here by accident.","female":"You're not here by accident.","variant_male_record_index":"63828","variant_female_record_index":"63829","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:2:3":{"text":"Don't try to flatter us!","source_cn":"夸我也没用！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1AEA0A5869425292","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Don't try to flatter us!","female":"Don't try to flatter us!","variant_male_record_index":"63830","variant_female_record_index":"63831","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿德":{"text":"Odie","source":